{12015}{I will not follow one who travels the path of righteousness.}{I will not follow one who travels the path of righteousness.}{}{1}{}{}
{12016}{I will not do the bidding of the dishonorable.}{I will not do the bidding of the dishonorable.}{}{2}{}{}
{12017}{I would never follow one who revolts me as you do.}{I would never follow one who revolts me as you do.}{}{3}{}{}
{12018}{I thank you again for restoring my life. I hope our paths may cross again.}{I thank you again for restoring my life. I hope our paths may cross again.}{}{4}{}{}
{12019}{I can not believe I followed one as low as yourself. Begone with you, then.}{I can not believe I followed one as low as yourself. Begone with you, then.}{}{5}{}{}
{12020}{Your order has been executed, sir.}{Your order has been executed, madam.}{}{6}{}{}
{12021}{I regret that I may not fulfill that request.}{I regret that I may not fulfill that request.}{}{7}{}{}
{12022}{Please target our opponents and not myself.}{Please target our opponents and not myself.}{}{8}{}{}
{12023}{I must say I am speechless before the grace with which you wield your weapons of destruction.}{I must say I am speechless before the grace with which you wield your weapons of destruction.}{}{9}{}{}
{12024}{I can not believe you would miss such an easy blow!}{I can not believe you would miss such an easy blow!}{}{10}{}{}
{12026}{I do not care to travel in a large group. It is too tempting of a target.}{I do not care to travel in a large group. It is too tempting of a target.}{}{11}{}{}
{12027}{I will not follow one I have no respect for.}{I will not follow one I have no respect for.}{}{12}{}{}
{12028}{I am afraid not, your inexperience would endanger us. Come back when you have withstood a few more battles.}{I am afraid not, your inexperience would endanger us. Come back when you have withstood a few more battles.}{}{13}{}{}
{12029}{Aaaagh! Retreat!}{Aaaagh! Retreat!}{}{14}{}{}
{12046}{Please, let me do that for you.}{Please, let me do that for you.}{}{15}{}{}
{12047}{It is dishonorable to attack those of our own party!}{It is dishonorable to attack those of our own party!}{}{16}{}{}
{12048}{How dare you have me attack such a saintly creature!}{How dare you have me attack such a saintly creature!}{}{17}{}{}
{12049}{No! I can not abide attacking my people!}{No! I can not abide attacking my people!}{}{18}{}{}
{12050}{Stop! We mustn't attack those who have sworn to upheld the same ideals as I!}{Stop! We mustn't attack those who have sworn to upheld the same ideals as I!}{}{19}{}{}
{12051}{The purity of your spirit is beginning to offend me.}{The purity of your spirit is beginning to offend me.}{}{20}{}{}
{12052}{The darkness of your path is becoming disturbing to me.}{The darkness of your path is becoming disturbing to me.}{}{21}{}{}
{12053}{My hatred for you is growing.}{My hatred for you is growing.}{}{22}{}{}
{12054}{My wounds grow too severe to ignore. I am afraid I have failed you, sir.}{My wounds grow too severe to ignore. I am afraid I have failed you, madam.}{}{23}{}{}

